# Execute Program (Optimized)
# Takes tasks from planning phase and executes each with validation
#
# INVARIANTS:
# 1. PLAN.md is READ-ONLY - never modify
# 2. Tasks executed as specified - no shortcuts
# 3. Tests are part of each task - not separate
# 4. Everything developed must be validated
# 5. Issues documented in docs/issues/ - work stops on blockers
# 6. Discoveries documented in docs/discoveries/
# 7. Commits after each successful task
# 8. Completed tasks MOVED to tasks/complete/

use "shared/agents.prose"
use "shared/blocks.prose"

input plan_folder: "plans/2026-01-24-aspire-shared-resources"

# [rest of program...]
